  "author": "Riddim Rack",
  "description": "Screech lead: FM Morph shifted +9 st (a one-shot Mod A pushes the Shift toward +12 on the attack), 3-voice unison, Saturate into a high-resonance note-tied Comb- and an LP12 at 6 kHz to keep the fizz in check. No sub. Play: F3-C5, an octave or two above the bass line, short phrases and held screams; mono legato with 50 ms portamento between overlapping notes. Tweak: Osc A Shift for the vowel of the scream, Osc A Index for FM brightness, Filter A Res for ring, Filter B Freq for harshness. Macro plan (not wired yet): Scream = Osc A Shift, Bright = Osc A Index, Ring = Filter A Res, Fizz = Filter B Freq.",
